cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AmpScape, please cite the dataset and the upstream sources listed under references."
title: "AmpScape: a benchmark for learned surrogates of circuit-theoretic landscape connectivity"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Xiao
    given-names: Yao
version: 0.2.0-mini
date-released: "2026-09-07"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Xyrro/AmpScape"
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/Xirro/AmpScape"
license: CC-BY-4.0
license-url: "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
keywords: [landscape connectivity, Circuitscape, Omniscape, surrogate models, neural operators, benchmark, ecology]
abstract: >
  Resistance rasters and source configurations paired with exact Circuitscape.jl / Omniscape.jl outputs
  (current-density maps, voltage maps, effective resistances, omnidirectional connectivity) on synthetic
  and real landscapes, with official spatial splits and out-of-distribution test sets, for training and
  comparing learned surrogates of circuit-theoretic connectivity.
